ence xprompts[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Define artifact-reference renderers as contextual `#ref/` xprompts,[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]automatically synthesize and configure them for sidecar [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]repositories, and enforce one shared path-filter contract in [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]resolution and completion.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]artifact_reference_xprompts.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/artifact_reference_xprompts.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-ho[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-ho/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Add the shared reference and filter contract to sase-core[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]core-ref-contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-ref-contract: extend the Rust content-layout, artifact-reference, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]catalog, and completion wires with contextual ref sources, path filters,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and deterministic filtered-path behavior.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Build the Python ref registry and sidecar configuration[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]python-ref-registry[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-ref-contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]python-ref-registry: consume the new core contract, load `sase/refs`, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]synthesize sidecar ref xprompts, ship builtin renderers, and expose [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]validated config and catalog metadata.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Route artifact expansion through ref xprompts[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]artifact-rendering[dim] · [dim][/dim]after python-ref-registry[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]artifact-rendering: make `#ref/` and `@` use one late resolver-renderer [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pipeline while preserving staging, consumption tracking, builtin output [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]compatibility, and Jinja safety.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Unify filtered completion across invocation surfaces[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]reference-completion[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-ref-contract, python-ref-registry[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]reference-completion: drive TUI and LSP completion for both `@kind:` and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`#ref/kind` from the same filtered artifact inventory and invalidate it [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]on all relevant source/config changes.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Prove the end-to-end contract and document it[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]integration-and-docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after artifact-rendering, reference-completion[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]integration-and-docs: add cross-surface tests, migration/config [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]documentation, and full combined-tree verification for artifact [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reference xprompts.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-ho","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-ho.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"sase-ho.1"},"source_run_id":"run-8ae12dc7801ce73184c96bc459fd236e","started_at":"2026-08-08T17:40:58.196269+00:00","state":"active"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at"